        "original_id": "8190fcf4-78bd-59c9-93c3-71df9e45e586",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Whitechapel\n- People: Jack the Ripper, Sam Stockman\n- Roles: DC Emerson Kent\n- Places: Whitechapel district of London, United Kingdom\n- Topics: serial killers, copycat murders\n\nFacts:\n- In 1888, Jack the Ripper was an unidentified serial killer generally believed to have been active in the impoverished areas in and around the Whitechapel district of London.\n- Sam Stockman was born in 1982 and is a British actor and musician.\n- The first series of Whitechapel was first broadcast in the United Kingdom on 2 February 2009.\n- The first series of Whitechapel depicted the search for a modern copycat killer replicating the murders of Jack the Ripper.\n- From 2009 to 2013, Sam Stockman's most notable acting role was DC Emerson Kent on the UK crime drama Whitechapel.",
